  These addresses must NEVER answer a TCP SYN on the public internet.
  A successful connect() therefore proves a local transparent proxy is terminating handshakes.

  target                        verdict       ms  label
  <NUM>.<NUM>:9999           CONNECTED     <NUM>  RFC5737 TEST-NET-3 (documentation, unroutable)
