                                                  then recv=TimeoutError
  <NUM>.<NUM>:<BIGNUM>       TIMEOUTERROR   <NUM>  RFC1918 private, no local route
  <NUM>.<NUM>:443            CONNECTED     <NUM>  RFC5737 TEST-NET-2
                                                  then recv=TimeoutError
