                                                  then recv=TimeoutError
  github.com:5432             CONNECTED    <NUM>  GitHub on PostgreSQL port (no such service)
                                                  then recv=TimeoutError

  Verdict rule: if any unroutable/reserved target CONNECTS, then
    (a) port scanning from inside this sandbox is meaningless, and
    (b) application code must not treat 'socket connected' as reachability.
